          "_name": "list01",
          "_sourceTheme": "guidem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"guide-executive-section\" id=\"request-assistance-guide\">\n    <div class=\"executive-container\">\n        \n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"guide-header\">\n            <span class=\"header-tag\">KONTAKT AUFNEHMEN</span>\n            <h1 class=\"header-title\">Wie Sie uns erreichen</h1>\n            <p class=\"header-lead\">\n                Keine Formulare, keine komplizierten Dokumente – eine einfache WhatsApp-Nachricht oder E-Mail genügt, um den Prozess zu starten.\n            </p>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- General Disclaimer / Privacy Notice -->\n        <div class=\"disclaimer-banner privacy-banner\">\n            <div class=\"disclaimer-icon\">\n                <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"disclaimer-text\">\n                <strong>Null Bürokratie, voller Datenschutz:</strong> Auf dieser Website gibt es keine Anmeldeformulare und wir erfassen nicht automatisch personenbezogene Daten. Das ist eine bewusste Entscheidung: Empfindliche Informationen einer Familie sollten nicht dort gespeichert werden, wo kein echter Bedarf besteht. Senden Sie uns eine Nachricht in der Sprache, die Sie bevorzugen. Ein kurzer allgemeiner Überblick reicht völlig aus, alles Weitere klären wir im Gespräch.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 1: Who & Where (2 Columns) -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"title-icon\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>\n                </span> \n                Für wen dieses Angebot gilt &amp; Einzugsgebiet\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"two-column-grid\">\n                <!-- Target Audience -->\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3>Für wen der Service gedacht ist</h3>\n                    <p>Familien und Einzelpersonen aus der Ukraine, die sich derzeit in Nordbayern befinden oder kurz vor einem Umzug in diese Region stehen und Unterstützung in einem oder mehreren der folgenden Bereiche benötigen: Wohnen, Umgang mit dem Jobcenter, Anmeldung, Schul- oder Kindergartenanmeldung, Übersetzungen, Möbel und Ausstattung oder allgemeine Orientierung im lokalen System.</p>\n                    <div class=\"notice-highlight\">\n                        <strong>Anfragen für andere:</strong> Sie können sich auch im Namen einer anderen Person melden – etwa für Verwandte, Nachbarn oder Freunde – vorausgesetzt, diese sind darüber informiert und an der Unterstützung interessiert.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Region Limits -->\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3>Regionale Einschränkungen</h3>\n                    <p>Unsere Tätigkeit beschränkt sich strikt auf <strong>Nordbayern und Oberfranken</strong>.</p>\n                    <p>Anfragen aus anderen Regionen Deutschlands werden zwar empfangen und gelesen, in den meisten Fällen können wir jedoch keine praktische Hilfe vor Ort leisten. Wir werden jedoch unser Bestes tun, um Sie an eine relevante Kontaktperson oder Organisation in Ihrer Nähe zu verweisen.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 2: What to write -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"title-icon\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"></polyline><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"13\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"17\"></line><polyline points=\"10 9 9 9 8 9\"></polyline></svg>\n                </span> \n                Was Sie in Ihre erste Nachricht schreiben sollten\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"guide-card\">\n                <p class=\"guide-card-intro\">Um Zeit bei langwierigen Nachrichtenwechseln zu sparen, ist es sehr hilfreich, in Ihrer ersten Nachricht kurz die folgenden Details anzugeben:</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"card-details-grid\">\n                    <ul class=\"numbered-list\">\n                        <li><strong>1. Name:</strong> Ihr Vorname und wie Sie bevorzugt angesprochen werden möchten.</li>\n                        <li><strong>2. Standort:</strong> Die Stadt oder der Ort, an dem Sie sich derzeit befinden.</li>\n                        <li><strong>3. Haushaltsgröße:</strong> Wie viele Erwachsene und wie viele Kinder, zusammen mit dem Alter der Kinder.</li>\n                        <li><strong>4. Hauptanliegen:</strong> Was ist derzeit Ihr wichtigstes Anliegen oder Problem?</li>\n                        <li><strong>5. Priorität:</strong> Was ist dringend und was kann noch warten?</li>\n                        <li><strong>6. Fristen:</strong> Falls eine nahende Frist eingehalten werden muss – zum Beispiel ein Brief mit einem Rückmeldedatum oder ein Datum, an dem Sie eine vorübergehende Unterkunft verlassen müssen.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"rule-box doc-rule\">\n                    <div class=\"rule-header\">\n                        <svg class=\"rule-icon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"></polyline></svg>\n                        <h3>Bezüglich Dokumenten</h3>\n                    </div>\n                    <p>In dieser ersten Phase müssen keine offiziellen Dokumente oder Fotos angehängt werden. Falls später ein bestimmtes Dokument benötigt wird, um Ihren Fall zu verstehen, werden wir gezielt danach fragen und genau erklären, warum.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"card-details-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"detail-box lang-box\">\n                        <div class=\"lang-header\">\n                            <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"></path></svg>\n                            <h4>In welchen Sprachen können Sie sich melden?</h4>\n                        </div>\n                        <p><strong>Ukrainisch, Russisch, Deutsch und Englisch.</strong> Bitte schreiben Sie in der Sprache, die für Sie am angenehmsten ist. Es ist immer besser, eine klare Erklärung in Ihrer Muttersprache zu verfassen als eine unsichere, übersetzte Formulierung auf Deutsch.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 3: The Process -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"title-icon\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"23 4 23 10 17 10\"></polyline><path d=\"M20.49 15a9 9 0 1 1-2.12-9.36L23 10\"></path></svg>\n                </span> \n                Was passiert, nachdem Sie uns kontaktiert haben?\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"three-column-grid\">\n                <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                    <div class=\"mini-icon step-badge\">1</div>\n                    <h3>Lesen &amp; Verstehen</h3>\n                    <p>Wir lesen alles, was Sie geschrieben haben, um uns ein Gesamtbild Ihrer Situation zu machen.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                    <div class=\"mini-icon step-badge\">2</div>\n                    <h3>Rückfragen</h3>\n                    <p>Wir stellen möglicherweise ein paar kurze Nachfragen, um genau zu verstehen, was erforderlich ist.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                    <div class=\"mini-icon step-badge\">3</div>\n                    <h3>Einschätzung</h3>\n                    <p>Wir prüfen, was wir praktisch tun können – basierend auf Ihrem Standort, Ihrem konkreten Anliegen und unserer aktuellen Verfügbarkeit.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                    <div class=\"mini-icon step-badge\">4</div>\n                    <h3>Ehrliche Antwort</h3>\n                    <p>Wir sagen Ihnen direkt, was möglich ist und was nicht. Wenn wir nicht helfen können, teilen wir Ihnen das zügig mit, anstatt Sie warten zu lassen.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"guide-mini-card full-width-step\">\n                    <div class=\"mini-icon step-badge\">5</div>\n                    <h3>Fortlaufende Unterstützung</h3>\n                    <p>Wenn wir helfen können, legen wir gemeinsam die nächsten Schritte fest und begleiten Sie durch den gesamten Prozess.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 4: Expectations & Emergency -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"title-icon\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m16 16 3-8 3 8c-.87.65-1.92 1-3 1s-2.13-.35-3-1Z\"></path><path d=\"m2 16 3-8 3 8c-.87.65-1.92 1-3 1s-2.13-.35-3-1Z\"></path><path d=\"M7 21h10\"></path><path d=\"M12 3v18\"></path><path d=\"M3 7h18\"></path></svg>\n                </span> \n                Erwartungen &amp; Notfallinformationen\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"two-column-grid\">\n                <!-- What we guarantee / cannot guarantee -->\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3>Was wir nicht garantieren können</h3>\n                    <p>Wir garantieren nicht das Finden einer Wohnung, die Bewilligung durch das Jobcenter, einen Platz im Kindergarten oder der Schule, die Gewährung finanzieller Leistungen oder eine sofortige Lösung. Wir können die Entscheidungen von Behörden nicht beeinflussen und bieten keine rechtsverbindliche Beratung an.</p>\n                    <hr class=\"card-divider\">\n                    <h3 class=\"highlight-green-title\">Was wir Garantieren</h3>\n                    <p>Wir versprechen, dass wir jede Anfrage lesen, ernsthaft prüfen, Ihnen ehrlich antworten und <strong>Ihnen niemals etwas berechnen werden.</strong></p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Emergency Block -->\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard emergency-card\">\n                    <div class=\"emergency-header\">\n                        <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3z\"></path><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"13\"></line><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"17\"></line></svg>\n                        <h3 class=\"emergency-title\">Dies ist keine Notrufnummer</h3>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"emergency-subtitle\">Eine Kontaktaufnahme mit uns ist nicht für lebensbedrohliche oder gefährliche Situationen gedacht.</p>\n                    <p class=\"emergency-desc\">Im Falle einer unmittelbaren Gefahr – medizinisch, sicherheitsrelevant oder anderweitig – wenden Sie sich bitte sofort an die offiziellen Notdienste in Deutschland:</p>\n                    <ul class=\"numbered-list emergency-list\">\n                        <li>\n                            <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg>\n                            <span><strong>112</strong> — Rettungsdienst &amp; Feuerwehr</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li>\n                            <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg>\n                            <span><strong>110</strong> — Polizei</span>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- CTA Area -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <div class=\"guide-card cta-card\">\n                <h3>Kontaktieren Sie uns direkt</h3>\n                <p class=\"cta-notice\">\n                    Bitte beachten Sie: Die direkte E-Mail-Adresse für Unterstützung finden Sie am Ende dieser Seite.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"cta-sub\">\n                    Wählen Sie die Methode, die für Sie am bequemsten ist:\n                </p>\n                \n                <!-- BUTTONS (Mobirise Compatible) -->\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn cta-buttons-wrapper\" mbr-buttons=\"true\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a class=\"btn custom-btn whatsapp-btn display-4 btn-warning\" href=\"https://wa.me/380637004615\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z\"></path></svg>\n                        WhatsApp Anna\n                    </a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_anchor": "list01-2d",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vqptsrc2Fe",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "footer4",
          "_sourceTheme": "restaurantm4",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)",
            "*:focus": {
              "outline": "none",
              "box-shadow": "none"
            },
            ".form-control": {
              "width": "100%",
              "background": "@inputBg",
              "border-radius": "0 !important",
              "border": "none !important",
              "min-height": "47px",
              "&::-webkit-input-placeholder": {
                "color": "contrast(@inputBg)"
              },
              "&::-moz-placeholder": {
                "color": "contrast(@inputBg)"
              },
              "&:-ms-input-placeholder": {
                "color": "contrast(@inputBg)"
              },
              "&:-moz-placeholder": {
                "color": "contrast(@inputBg)"
              }
            },
            "input.form-control": {
              "padding": "0.5rem"
            },
            ".soc-item": {
              "display": "inline-block",
              "margin": "0 0.1rem 0.2rem 0.1rem",
              "padding": "10px 11px 0 11px",
              "border": "2px solid @iconsColor !important",
              "border-radius": "50% !important",
              "&:hover": {
                "opacity": "0.5"
              },
              ".socicon": {
                "font-size": "1.5rem",
                "color": "@iconsColor"
              }
            },
            ".days-column, .hours-column": {
              "display": "inline-block",
              "span": {
                "display": "block"
              }
            },
            ".logo": {
              "img": {
                "width": "auto",
                "display": "inline-block"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".days-column": {
                "padding-right": "0 !important"
              },
              ".hours-column": {
                "max-width": "50% !important"
              },
              ".opening-hours": {
                "padding-bottom": "48px !important"
              }
            },
            ".form-title, .btn-row": {
              "color": "#0c2c68"
            },
            ".follow-title, .social-list, .logo": {
              "color": "#0c2c68"
            },
            ".address-title, .address-block": {
              "color": "#0c2c68"
            },
            ".hours-column": {
              "color": "#0c2c68"
            },
            ".opening-hours-title, .opening-hours": {
              "color": "#0c2c68"
            },
            ".contacts-title, .contacts-block": {
              "color": "#0c2c68",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            "LABEL": {
              "color": "#0c2c68"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"footer4 restaurantm4_footer4\" group=\"Footers\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-reveal': reveal, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"formstyler, datepicker\">\n\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<!-- Block parameters controls -->\n\t\t<header>Größe</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Oben\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Unten\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n\t\t<select title=\"Icons\" name=\"iconsCount\" condition=\"showIcons\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"1\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"2\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\">4</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"5\">5</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"6\">6</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<header>Anzeigen / Ausblenden</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Icons\" name=\"showIcons\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Icons Farbe\" name=\"iconsColor\" value=\"#0c2c68\" condition=\"showIcons\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Kontakte\" name=\"showContacts\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Formular\" name=\"showForm\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Eingabe Hg\" name=\"inputBg\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"showForm\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reveal-Effekt\" name=\"reveal\">\n\t\t<header>Hintergrund</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Bild\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background8.jpg\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Farbe\" value=\"#f7f7f7\" selected>\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Farbe\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#232323\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Deckkraft\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<!-- End block parameters -->\n\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"usedRecaptcha\" value=\"false\"></mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row content justify-content-center align-items-start mbr-white\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<!-- Kontakt- und Unterstützungsinformationen -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-5 col-lg-5 pb-4\" mbr-if=\"showContacts || showIcons\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"contacts\" mbr-if=\"showContacts\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"contacts-title mbr-fonts-style pb-2 align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".contacts-title, .contacts-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Brauchen Sie Hilfe?</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"contacts-block mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".contacts-title, .contacts-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWir sind hier, um ukrainische Familien in Nordbayern bei der Wohnungs- und Behördenkoordination sowie der Integration zu unterstützen.<br><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>WhatsApp-Support:</strong><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://wa.me/380637004615\" class=\"text-primary\">+380 63 700 4615</a><br><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Hauptzentrum:</strong><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tKonradsreuth Alte Hofer Str. 1 ⚲<br><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>E-Mail schreiben:</strong><br><a href=\"mailto:zusammenleben.de@gmail.com\" class=\"text-primary\">zusammenleben.de@gmail.com&nbsp;✉</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"social-list pt-3 align-left\" mbr-if=\"showIcons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"soc-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://wa.me/380637004615\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social socicon-whatsapp socicon\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"iconsCount > 1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social socicon-facebook socicon\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"iconsCount > 2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social socicon-instagram socicon\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"iconsCount > 3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span mbr-icon class=\"socicon-instagram socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"iconsCount > 4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span mbr-icon class=\"socicon-googleplus socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"iconsCount > 5\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span mbr-icon class=\"socicon-behance socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<!-- Hilfe-Anfrageformular -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"form-1 col-12 col-md-7 col-lg-6\" mbr-if=\"showForm\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"form-title pb-3 mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".form-title, .btn-row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<b>Unterstützung anfordern</b>\n\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div mbr-form>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!--Formbuilder Form-->\n\t\t\t\t\t<form action=\"zusammenleben.de@gmail.com\" name=\"Assistance Request Form\" method=\"POST\" class=\"mbr-form form-with-styler\" data-verified=\"zusammenleben.de@gmail.com\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div hidden=\"hidden\" data-form-alert class=\"alert alert-success col-12\">Vielen Dank! Ihre Anfrage wurde gesendet. Wir werden uns Kürze bei Ihnen melden.</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div hidden=\"hidden\" data-form-alert-danger class=\"alert alert-danger col-12\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dragArea row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12 form-group mb-3\" data-for=\"full name\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"text\" name=\"full name\" placeholder=\"*Vollständiger Name\" data-form-field=\"full name\" style=\"text-align:left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" required=\"required\" class=\"form-control\" value>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12 form-group mb-3\" data-for=\"tel\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"tel\" name=\"tel\" placeholder=\"*Telefon / WhatsApp\" data-form-field=\"tel\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" required=\"required\" style=\"text-align:left\" class=\"form-control\" value>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-for=\"email\" class=\"col-md-12 form-group mb-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"E-Mail-Adresse\" style=\"text-align:left\" data-form-field=\"E-mail\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"form-control\" value>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-for=\"message\" class=\"col-md-12 form-group mb-3 pb-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<textarea name=\"message\" placeholder=\"Wie können wir Ihnen helfen? (Unterkunft, Jobcenter, Schule, Übersetzung usw.)\" data-form-field=\"Message\" style=\"text-align:left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"form-control\" rows=\"4\"></textarea>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 form-group mb-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-for=\"I agree to the terms and conditions and privacy policy\" class=\"form-check me-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"Yes\" name=\"I agree to the terms and conditions and privacy policy\" data-form-field=\"I agree to the terms and conditions\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"form-check-input\" required=\"required\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<label mbr-text for=\"I agree to the terms and conditions and privacy policy\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"form-check-label text-muted\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIch stimme den <a href=\"usingtheweb.html\" class=\"text-black\">Allgemeinen Geschäftsbedingungen</a> &amp; der <a href=\"privacy.html\" class=\"text-black\">Datenschutzerklärung</a> zu\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12 input-group-btn align-center\" mbr-buttons=\"true\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-mbrBtnAdd\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-100 btn btn-form btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Hilfeanfrage senden</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!--Formbuilder Form-->\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_anchor": "footer4-1z",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vqj20Eg7Ge",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            "& when (@fullWidth)": {
              ".container-fluid": {
                "padding": "0 56px",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding": "0 22px"
                }
              }
            },
            ".container": {
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "0 22px"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "justify-content": "space-between"
            },
            ".logo-wrapper": {
              "margin-bottom": "1.5rem",
              "img": {
                "width": "(@logoWidth * 1px)",
                "max-width": "100%",
                "height": "auto",
                "object-fit": "contain"
              }
            },
            ".content-wrapper": {
              "margin-bottom": "32px",
              ".mbr-section-title": {
                "margin-bottom": "32px"
              },
              ".mbr-text": {
                "margin-bottom": "32px"
              }
            },
            ".lists-wrapper": {
              "display": "grid",
              "grid-template-columns": "1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr",
              "gap": "1rem",
              "margin-bottom": "32px",
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "grid-template-columns": "1fr 1fr 1fr"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
                "grid-template-columns": "1fr"
              },
              ".list-wrap": {
                ".list": {
                  "padding": "0",
                  "margin": "0",
                  "list-style-type": "none",
                  ".item-wrap": {
                    "margin-bottom": "8px",
                    "cursor": "pointer",
                    "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out",
                    "&:first-child": {
                      "color": "@activeList"
                    },
                    "&:last-child": {
                      "margin-bottom": "0"
                    },
                    "&:hover, &:focus": {
                      "color": "@activeList"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".copy-wrapper": {
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "space-between",
              "& when (@showBorder)": {
                "border-top": "1px solid @border",
                "padding-top": "16px"
              },
              "& when not (@showSocial)": {
                "justify-content": "center"
              },
              "& when not (@showCopy)": {
                "justify-content": "center"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "display": "block"
              },
              ".social-wrapper": {
                "width": "50%",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "width": "100%",
                  "margin-bottom": "16px"
                },
                ".social-wrap": {
                  "display": "inline-flex",
                  "flex-wrap": "wrap",
                  ".soc-item": {
                    "margin-left": "32px",
                    "&:first-child": {
                      "margin-left": "0"
                    },
                    "a": {
                      "display": "block",
                      "&:hover, &:focus": {
                        ".mbr-iconfont": {
                          "color": "@active"
                        }
                      },
                      ".mbr-iconfont": {
                        "font-size": "16px",
                        "color": "@socColor",
                        "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              ".mbr-copy": {
                "width": "50%",
                "margin-bottom": "0",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "width": "100%"
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#ff5753"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".list": {
              "color": "#635d60"
            },
            ".mbr-copy": {
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "text-align": "right"
            },
            ".list, .item-wrap": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            }
          },
          "_name": "footer01",
          "_sourceTheme": "scalem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"footer01 scalem5\" group=\"Footer\" global once=\"footers\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Logo\" name=\"showLogo\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Logo Width\" name=\"logoWidth\" min=\"50\" max=\"400\" step=\"10\" value=\"150\" condition=\"showLogo\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Lists\" name=\"showLists\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Amount\" name=\"list\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"showLists\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"List Active Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"activeList\" condition=\"showLists\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Social\" name=\"showSocial\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Social Amount\" name=\"soc\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"showSocial\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Social Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"socColor\" condition=\"showSocial\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Social Active Color\" value=\"#FF5753\" name=\"active\" condition=\"showSocial\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Border\" name=\"showBorder\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#635d60\" name=\"border\" condition=\"showBorder\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Copyright\" name=\"showCopy\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#0c2c68\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#292325\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.2\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n            \n            <!-- עמודת טקסט וכותרת ראשית -->\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showButtons || showLogo\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <!-- תוספת המקום ללוגו -->\n                    <div class=\"logo-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showLogo\">\n                        <a href=\"index.html\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-3uwvbn3uwvbn3uwv.png-171x171.png\" alt=\"Logo\">\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>\n                        ZUSAMMENLEBEN\n                    </b></h4>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                        Unterstützung bei Integration, Wohnen und Gemeinschaft für Neuzugezogene und Einheimische in der Region.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"Contact.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-phone mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>\n                            Kontaktieren Sie uns\n                        </a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- עמודות הקישורים -->\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-7\" mbr-if=\"showLists\">\n                <div class=\"lists-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-white\">Startseite</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"family-stories.html\" class=\"text-white\">Familiengeschichten</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"services.html\" class=\"text-white\">Leistungen</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"request-assistance.html\" class=\"text-white\">Hilfe anfordern</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"community.html\" class=\"text-white\">Gemeinschaft</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 1\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"living-in-germany.html\" class=\"text-white\">Leben in Deutschland</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"glossary.html\" class=\"text-white\">Glossar</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"learning-german.html\" class=\"text-white\">Deutsch lernen</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"refugee-rights.html\" class=\"text-white\">Flüchtlingsrechte</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"anna-shishoili.html\" class=\"text-white\">Anna Shishoili</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 2\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"how-to-help.html\" class=\"text-white\">Wie Sie helfen können</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"social-activity.html\" class=\"text-white\">Soziale Aktivitäten</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"faq.html\" class=\"text-white\">Häufige Fragen (FAQ)</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"areasweserve.html\" class=\"text-white\">Einsatzgebiete</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 3\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"emergency.html\" class=\"text-white\">Notfall</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"Contact.html\" class=\"text-white\">Kontakt</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"https://wa.me/380637004615\" class=\"text-white\" target=\"_blank\">WhatsApp-Support</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"areasweserve.html\" class=\"text-white\">Standort</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 4\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white\">Datenschutzerklärung</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white\">Nutzungsbedingungen</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white\">Impressum</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-white\">Offizielle Website</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- אזור זכויות יוצרים ורשתות חברתיות -->\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-if=\"showSocial || showCopy\">\n                <div class=\"copy-wrapper\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                    <div class=\"social-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                        <div class=\"social-wrap\">\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\">\n                                <a href=\"https://wa.me/380637004615\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-whatsapp\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 1\">\n                                <a href=\"mailto:info@zusammenleben.de\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-letter mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 2\">\n                                <a href=\"#\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-telegram\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 3\">\n                                <a href=\"#\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-instagram\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-copy mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-copy, .social-wrapper\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showCopy\">\n                        © Urheberrecht 2026 Zusammenleben - Alle Rechte vorbehalten\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
