rd-en\">Official application</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Antrag stellen</div><div class=\"word-en\">To submit an application</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Formular</div><div class=\"word-en\">Form</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">ausfüllen</div><div class=\"word-en\">To fill out</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">unterschreiben</div><div class=\"word-en\">To sign</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Unterschrift</div><div class=\"word-en\">Signature</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Bescheid</div><div class=\"word-en\">Official written decision</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Bewilligung</div><div class=\"word-en\">Approval / Grant</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Ablehnung</div><div class=\"word-en\">Rejection</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Widerspruch</div><div class=\"word-en\">Appeal / Objection</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Frist</div><div class=\"word-en\">Deadline</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Nachweis</div><div class=\"word-en\">Proof / Evidence</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Bescheinigung</div><div class=\"word-en\">Official certificate</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Meldebescheinigung</div><div class=\"word-en\">Address registration certificate</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Aufenthaltstitel</div><div class=\"word-en\">Residence permit document</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Aufenthaltserlau